{
  "title": "MIDI Out",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Sends this slot's",
        "MIDI out of the",
        "USB-A port, to an",
        "external synth or",
        "any class-compliant",
        "MIDI device.",
        "",
        "Put it after other",
        "MIDI FX: what Chord",
        "or Arp produce is",
        "what goes out.",
        "",
        "With Thru on, all of",
        "it also passes on",
        "down the chain, so",
        "a synth after it",
        "still plays. Turn",
        "Thru off to play",
        "only the external",
        "one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Channel",
      "lines": [
        "Knob 1: MIDI Channel",
        " 1 to 16",
        "",
        "Every note, CC, bend",
        "and aftertouch goes",
        "out on this channel,",
        "whatever channel it",
        "came in on.",
        "",
        "Change it while",
        "holding notes and",
        "they still release",
        "on the channel they",
        "started on."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Thru",
      "lines": [
        "Knob 2: Thru",
        " On (default) or Off",
        "",
        "On: MIDI also goes",
        "on, unchanged, to",
        "the slot's synth and",
        "any MIDI FX after",
        "this one.",
        "",
        "Off: notes, CCs and",
        "bend go only out of",
        "USB-A.",
        "",
        "Clock still passes,",
        "so tempo sync keeps",
        "working. Notes held",
        "when you turn it off",
        "still release on the",
        "slot's synth."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tips",
      "lines": [
        "Clock is not sent -",
        "turn on Move's own",
        "MIDI Clock Out for",
        "tempo sync.",
        "",
        "Move's tracks can",
        "send MIDI out of",
        "USB-A too. Pick a",
        "channel they do not",
        "use, or the synth",
        "hears both.",
        "",
        "Leave the slot's",
        "MIDI FX setting on",
        "Schw. Schw+Move",
        "also sends notes to",
        "Move, which echoes",
        "them to USB-A, so",
        "they double.",
        "",
        "If the external",
        "synth echoes MIDI",
        "back in, turn off",
        "its own MIDI thru."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
